_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\"><b>Opportunity Attack</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>Attack an enemy moving out of reach.</p></div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Technical</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>S_IRN_DeadHostage01</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_IRN_DeadHostage01+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_IRN_DeadHostage01+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uuid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UUID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>b306d6ce-a270-429e-be82-86e7e31bb7dd</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b306d6ce-a270-429e-be82-86e7e31bb7dd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b306d6ce-a270-429e-be82-86e7e31bb7dd\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stats\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">Stats</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>Human_Commoner</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Human_Commoner+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Human_Commoner+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>Civilian</b> is a dead <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">human</a> prisoner in the <a href=\"/wiki/Iron_Throne\" title=\"Iron Throne\">Iron Throne</a>.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Civilian (Human) is in a locked cell in the western wing of the underwater prison, next to the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ulder_Ravengard\" title=\"Ulder Ravengard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png/25px-Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png/38px-Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png/50px-Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duke Ravengard's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png/25px-Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ulder_Ravengard\" title=\"Ulder Ravengard\">Duke Ravengard's</a> cell.\n</p><p>Presumably, he is one of two prisoners (the other one is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Civilian_(Gnome,_Iron_Throne)\" title=\"Civilian (Gnome, Iron Throne)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Civilian_%28Gnome%2C_Iron_Throne%29.png/25px-Portrait_Civilian_%28Gnome%2C_Iron_Throne%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Civilian_%28Gnome%2C_Iron_Throne%29.png/38px-Portrait_Civilian_%28Gnome%2C_Iron_Throne%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Civilian_%28Gnome%2C_Iron_Throne%29.png/50px-Portrait_Civilian_%28Gnome%2C_Iron_Throne%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Civilian (Gnome, Iron Throne)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Civilian_%28Gnome%2C_Iron_Throne%29.png/25px-Portrait_Civilian_%28Gnome%2C_Iron_Throne%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Portrait_Civilian_%28Gnome%2C_Iron_Throne%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Civilian_(Gnome,_Iron_Throne)\" title=\"Civilian (Gnome, Iron Throne)\">Civilian (Gnome, Iron Throne)</a>) who can be seen through the Scrying screen in the Security Office of the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watch_Foundry#Main_Floor\" title=\"Steel Watch Foundry\">Steel Watch Foundry</a>.\n</p><p>As the human is already dead, he counts neither for fulfilling the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Save_the_Gondians\" title=\"Save the Gondians\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Save the Gondians\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Save_the_Gondians\" title=\"Save the Gondians\">Save the Gondians</a> quest nor for the corresponding <a href=\"/wiki/Inspiration\" title=\"Inspiration\">inspiration</a> granted to the characters with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Folk_Hero\" title=\"Folk Hero\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Background_Folk_Hero_Icon.png/20px-Background_Folk_Hero_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Background_Folk_Hero_Icon.png/30px-Background_Folk_Hero_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Background_Folk_Hero_Icon.png/40px-Background_Folk_Hero_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Folk Hero\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Background_Folk_Hero_Icon.png/20px-Background_Folk_Hero_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Background_Folk_Hero_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Folk_Hero\" title=\"Folk Hero\">Folk Hero</a> background.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_quests\">Related quests</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Save_the_Gondians\" title=\"Save the Gondians\"><picture><source 